## Conventions

<!-- Language versions, formatting, how types stay in sync, whatever a session
     needs to match the surrounding code rather than guess. -->

## The handoff protocol

Any session that does real work ends by running `/checkout`: one line appended to
`.agent/log/sessions.jsonl` and a rewrite of `.agent/projects/<slug>.md` (status
/ what changed / next step / blockers). The protocol is plain files, so any tool
can participate by following the same instructions.
